    - Term: ClaimVideoTip
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'You can claim the reward after

        watch ads video for 4 more time'
      - "\u062A\u0633\u062A\u0637\u064A\u0639 \u0645\u0637\u0627\u0644\u0628\u062A\u0647
        \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0627\u0626\u0632\u0629 \u0628\u0639\u062F \u0645\u0634\u0627\u0647\u062F\u0629
        \u0625\u0639\u0644\u0627\u0646 \u0623\u0642\u0644\u0647\u0627 4 \u0645\u0631\u0627\u062A"
      - "Voc\xEA pode claiming o pr\xEAmio ap\xF3s assistir a 4 v\xEDdeos de an\xFAncio
        a mais."
      - "Puedes reclamar la recompensa despu\xE9s de ver 4 v\xEDdeos publicitarios
        m\xE1s."
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
