    - Term: Level10Tips0
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Pull the carpet, then take the mosquito racket to kill mosquitoes
      - "\u0627\u0633\u062D\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u062C\u0627\u062F\u0629\u060C
        \u062B\u0645 \u0623\u062E\u064F\u0630 \u0639\u0635\u0627\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0642\u062A\u0627\u0644
        \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0631\u0627\u0626\u062F \u0644\u0642\u062A\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0631\u0627\u062F."
      - "Puxe a moeda para o ch\xE3o"
      - "Tira la alfombra, luego toma el raquet\xF3n para mosquitos para matarlos."
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level10Tips1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Open the bedside drawer, take the lighter to light mosquito incense
      - "\u0627\u0641\u062A\u062D \u062F\u0631\u062C \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0631\u064A\u0631
        \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0627\u0646\u0628\u064A\u060C \u062E\u0630 \u0627\u0644\u0648\u0644\u0627\u0639\u0629
        \u0644\u0625\u0634\u0639\u0627\u0644 \u0628\u062E\u0648\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u0639\u0648\u0636"
      - Jogue o marido pela janela com sua amante
      - "Abre el caj\xF3n de la mesita de noche, toma el encendedor para encender
        el incienso contra mosquitos."
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level10Tips10
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - When the girl's leg is no longer swollen, pull the blanket to help her sleep
      - "\u0639\u0646\u062F\u0645\u0627 \u062A\u0632\u064A\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u062Aumo\u0627\u0631
        \u0639\u0646 \u0633\u0627\u0642 \u0627\u0644\u0641\u062A\u0627\u0629\u060C
        \u0627\u0633\u062D\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u063A\u0637\u0627\u0621 \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0633\u0627\u0639\u062F\u0629
        \u0639\u0644\u064A\u0647\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0648\u0645."
      - Puxe a moeda para a mesa
      - "Cuando la pierna de la chica ya no est\xE9 inflamada, tira la manta para
        ayudarla a dormir."
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level10Tips2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Open the wardrobe, give the girl a nightgown
      - "\u0627\u0641\u062A\u062D \u062E\u0632\u0646\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0644\u0627\u0628\u0633\u060C
        \u0623\u0639\u0637 \u0627\u0644\u0641\u062A\u0627\u0629 \u0641\u0633\u062A\u0627\u0646
        \u0644\u064A\u0644\u0627\u0648\u064A."
      - Puxe a moeda para a comida
      - "Abre el armario, dale a la chica un camis\xF3n."
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level10Tips3
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Open the wardrobe, give the girl a blanket
      - " \u0627\u0641\u062A\u062D \u062E\u0632\u0646\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0644\u0627\u0628\u0633\u060C
        \u0623\u0639\u0637 \u0627\u0644\u0641\u062A\u0627\u0629 \u063A\u0637\u0627\u0621."
      - Puxe a moeda para a cama
      - Abre el armario, dale a la chica una manta.
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level10Tips4
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Take the spray behind the pillow to kill mosquitoes
      - " \u0623\u062E\u064F\u0630 \u0627\u0644\u0631\u0634\u0627\u0637 \u062E\u0644\u0641
        \u0627\u0644\u0648\u0633\u0627\u062F\u0629 \u0644\u0642\u062A\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0631\u0627\u062F."
      - Puxe a moeda para a garota
      - "Toma el aerosol detr\xE1s de la almohada para matar mosquitos."
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level10Tips5
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Pull the spider web to make a curtain for the girl
      - "\u0627\u0633\u062D\u0628 \u0634\u0628\u0643\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0646\u0643\u0628\u0648\u062A
        \u0644\u0635\u0646\u0639 \u0645\u0646\u0628\u0631\u0629 \u0644\u0644\u0641\u062A\u0627\u0629."
      - Puxe a moeda para a janela
      - "Tira de la telara\xF1a de ara\xF1a para hacerle una cortina a la chica."
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level10Tips6
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Turn on the ceiling fan with the red switch
      - "\u0642\u0645 \u0628\u062A\u062D\u0648\u064A\u0644 \u0645\u0631\u0648\u062D
        \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0642\u0641 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0634\u0628\u0643\u0629
        \u0627\u0644\u062D\u0645\u0631\u0627\u0621."
      - Empurre a moeda para a porta principal
      - Enciende el abanico de techo con el interruptor rojo.
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level10Tips7
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Light the oil lamp to drive away mosquitoes
      - "\u0627\u0631\u0642\u064A \u0645\u0635\u0628\u0627\u062D \u0627\u0644\u0632\u064A\u062A
        \u0644\u0637\u0631\u062F \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0631\u0627\u062F."
      - "Puxe a moeda para a l\xE2mpada"
      - "Enciende la l\xE1mpara de aceite para ahuyentar los mosquitos."
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level10Tips8
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Pull the curtain and see what happens
      - "\u0627\u0633\u062D\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0648\u0631\u0637\u064A\u0646
        \u0648\u0627\u0631\u0649 \u0645\u0627\u0630\u0627 \u064A\u062D\u062F\u062B."
      - "Puxe o dinheiro para o rel\xF3gio"
      - Tira las cortinas y ve lo que sucede.
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level10Tips9
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - After driving away all the mosquitoes, give the girl the ointment tube from
        the drawer
      - "\u0628\u0639\u062F \u0637\u0631\u062F \u0643\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0631\u0627\u062F\u060C
        \u0623\u0639\u0637 \u0627\u0644\u0641\u062A\u0627\u0629 \u0623\u0646\u0628\u0648\u0628
        \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0645 Poultice \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0635\u0646."
      - Puxe o dinheiro para o tapete rasgado
      - "Despu\xE9s de ahuyentar a todos los mosquitos, dale a la chica la tuber\xEDa
        de ung\xFCento del caj\xF3n."
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level11Tips0
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Take the boy's shirt from afa
      - "\u0623\u062E\u064F\u0630 \u0642\u0645\u064A\u0635 \u0627\u0644\u0635\u0628\u064A
        \u0645\u0646 afa."
      - "Coloque o beb\xEA na cama de crian\xE7a."
      - Toma la camisa del chico de [afa]
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level11Tips1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Take the cloud from the sky
      - "\u062E\u062F \u0627\u0644\u0633\u062D\u0627\u0628\u0629 \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0645\u0627\u0621"
      - "Abra a porta principal e de dinheiro ao remetente para obter a caixa de
        leite para o beb\xEA"
      - Toma la nube del cielo.
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level11Tips2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Take the white flower
      - "\u0627\u062E\u062F \u0627\u0644\u0632\u0647\u0631\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u064A\u0636\u0629"
      - Puxe o dinheiro para o buraco do rato
      - Toma la flor blanca.
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level11Tips3
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Take the newspaper on the chair
      - "\u062E\u0630 \u0627\u0644\u062C\u0631\u064A\u062F\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u064A
        \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u0633\u064A"
      - Pegue o jornal na cadeira
      - "Toma el peri\xF3dico de la silla."
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level11Tips4
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Take the bird's feather
      - "\u062E\u0630 \u0631\u064A\u0634\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0637\u0627\u0626\u0631"
      - "Pegue a pena do p\xE1ssaro"
      - "Toma la pluma del p\xE1jaro."
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level11Tips5
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Use scissors to cut the cat's fur, then give it to the boy
      - "\u0627\u0633\u062A\u062E\u062F\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0642\u0635 \u0639\u0634\u0627\u0646
        \u062A\u0642\u0635 \u0634\u0639\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0637\u060C \u0628\u0639\u062F\u064A\u0646
        \u0627\u062F\u064A\u0644\u0647 \u0644\u0644\u0648\u0644\u062F."
      - "Use tesoura para cortar o pelo do gato, depois d\xEA ao menino"
      - "Usa las tijeras para cortar el pelaje del gato, luego d\xE1selo al ni\xF1o."
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level11Tips6
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Take the hair of the boy sitting on the toilet
      - "\u062E\u062F \u0634\u0639\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0648\u0644\u062F \u0627\u0644\u0644\u064A
        \u0642\u0627\u0639\u062F \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u062A\u0648\u0627\u0644\u064A\u062A."
      - Pegue o cabelo do menino sentado no banheiro
      - "Toma el cabello del ni\xF1o sentado en el inodoro."
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level11Tips7
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Take the sock of the boy sitting on the toilet
      - "\u062E\u062F \u062C\u0648\u0631\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0648\u0644\u062F \u0627\u0644\u0644\u064A
        \u0642\u0627\u0639\u062F \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u062D\u0645\u0627\u0645."
      - Pegue o sapato do menino sentado no banheiro
      - "Toma el calcet\xEDn del ni\xF1o sentado en el inodoro."
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level11Tips8
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Take the bush behind the chair
      - "\u062E\u062F \u0627\u0644\u0634\u062C\u064A\u0631\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u064A
        \u0648\u0631\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u0633\u064A"
      - "Pegue a vegeta\xE7\xE3o atr\xE1s da cadeira "
      - "Toma el arbusto detr\xE1s de la silla."
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level12Tips0
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Drag the money onto the floor
      - "\u0627\u0633\u062D\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0641\u0644\u0648\u0633 \u0639\u0644\u0649
        \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0631\u0636."
      - "Arraste o dinheiro para o ch\xE3o"
      - Arrastra el dinero hasta el suelo.
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Level12Tips1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Throw the husband out of the window with his mistress
      - "\u0627\u0642\u0630\u0641 \u0627\u0644\u0632\u0648\u062C \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0628\u0627\u0643
